<title>USA: Nimbus CD International Inc Q3 net rises.</title>
<headline>Nimbus CD International Inc Q3 net rises.</headline>
<dateline>CHARLOTTESVILLE, Va. 1997-02-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>(Dollars in thousands, except per share data)</p>
<p>			   Three Months Ended    Nine Months Ended</p>
<p>				December 31,	    December 31,</p>
<p>			    1996	    1995     1996	  1995</p>
<p> Net sales	   $40,352	 $36,645 $100,942     $88,497</p>
<p>Income before</p>
<p>extraordinary item</p>
<p>			   5,510	   3,980   11,066	 7,783</p>
<p>	Net income     5,510	   1,029   11,066	 4,832</p>
<p>Net income (1995</p>
