<p>  the Offering)	5,510	   4,257   11,066	 9,366</p>
<p>Earnings per share</p>
<p>(pro forma for</p>
<p>  the Offering)	 0.24	    0.19     0.48	  0.41</p>
<p>Weighted average shares</p>
<p>  outstanding	 22,958	  22,886   23,011	22,790</p>
<p>NOTE: 1995 results include a charge of $2.95 million from the extinguishment of debt.</p>
